            "review_text": "BFung S\n36 contributions\n0\nAmazing local desserts\nMar 2017 • Family\nA local introduced us to this shop. Was so happy with it that we went back twice after that. The staff are helpful polite and ready to explain the range of desserts.\nOur favourites were (1) coconut filled with jelly that had been made with the milk and water that was already in it. (2) mango pudding with and without sago pearls (3) caramel flan which was smooth, not too sweet and had the wonderful slightly burnt taste.\nEnjoy!\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2017",
